msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "Excepciones"

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:395
msgid ""
"Subclass of :exc:`ValueError`. Raised by the :class:`APDS9960` constructor "
"when the value read from the chip's ID register is not present in the "
"``valid_id`` list."
msgstr ""
"Subclase de :exc:`ValueError`. La genera el constructor de :class:`APDS9960`"
" cuando el valor leído del registro de ID del chip no está presente en la "
"lista ``valid_id``."

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:401
msgid ""
"Subclass of :exc:`ValueError`. Raised by :meth:`APDS9960.setMode` when the "
"``mode`` argument is outside the range :data:`APDS9960_MODE_POWER`..\\\\ "
":data:`APDS9960_MODE_ALL`."
msgstr ""
"Subclase de :exc:`ValueError`. La genera :meth:`APDS9960.setMode` cuando el "
"argumento ``mode`` está fuera del rango :data:`APDS9960_MODE_POWER`..\\\\ "
":data:`APDS9960_MODE_ALL`."

